== Overview ==
'''Boss Toilet 2.0''' is a boss [[Enemies|enemy]] that appears in [[Medium Mode]] as the final boss, [[Hard Mode]], and [[Nightmare Mode]]. It is Relatively easy to kill despite it being able to stun (due to most units having stun blocks).

== Waves ==
=== [[Medium Mode]] ===
Wave 30: x1 (214000 HP)
=== [[Nightmare Mode]] ===
Wave 17: x1 (136000 HP)

Wave 23: 166000 HP

Wave 28: 196000 HP

Wave 31: 220000 HP

Wave 38: 262000 HP

Wave 42: 280000 HP

Wave 50: 334000 HP

== Strategy ==

* Fairly Easy to take out, use a multi target unit with good DPS (such as [[Mystical Camerawoman]]).

== Trivia ==
* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/G-Man_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search#G-Man_Skibidi_Toilet_3.0 G-Man Skibidi Toilet 2.0].
* It is the second enemy that can stun units, the first being Vacuum Toilet.
* It is a stronger version of the [[Boss Toilet]], but has a stronger version that is called the [[Boss Toilet 3.0]].
* A Wave 1 Boss Toilet 2.0 have 51000HP, increasing 5000 HP per wave.

